{"ts":"2026-08-08T12:44:42.491Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"9814475673c87fd805d35390","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-08T12:44:42.491Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Finished the in-progress gate work and made every gate pass. Fixes to the inherited tests: corrected 4 nested-closure 'dir possibly null' reads in coverage-gate.test.ts (captured dir.root into a local const, the audit test's proven pattern); fixed a contradictory eqeqeq assertion in quality-scripts.test.ts (asserted ===undefined then ok-truthy; the config is ['error','always']); corrected the docstring-violation regex (symbol: reason, not symbol - reason); and made three isMainInvocation tests use real temp files (the launcher fails closed on non-existent paths via realpathSync). Coverage-gate.ts: made resolveEmitPaths/computeRequired accept an injectable show-config (consistent with runGate's injectable spawn) so the tsc-failure and type-only-ignore branches are reachable, and cleaned tsc's ./ prefixes so outDir/rootDir are stable; exported defaultSpawn for direct coverage. Replaced the self-recurse 'main runs the gate against the real repository' test (it spawned this test file) with non-recursive main() tests. Mutation-verified each new gate fails when its guard is violated: lint (explicit any -> exit 1), duplicates (a cloned function -> 1 clone over 0% threshold -> exit 1), audit:identities (drop approved stefan@preu.at -> rejects 1 non-public address -> exit 1), coverage-scripts (add an untested executable script -> 99.74% under 100% -> exit 1). All restored green. Final: typecheck/build/lint/duplicates/docstring/coverage/audit:identities all pass; coverage 100% lines/branches/functions across 8 source files."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-08T12:44:42.491Z"}],"before_hash":"24c2f6509b3812f1902ef668a402d8e70560b95ef1a256a80b0f8116e1567aeb","after_hash":"1b44b5e197236f50db11fbb04a325884252756a6dd45f00a8d6b3b5f75a12b58"}
